<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-Keppel Engineering 1H net down.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Keppel Engineering 1H net down.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   4.52  vs  7.39</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	  2.30  vs  3.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		   130.11  vs 145.79</p>
<p>    Other income		 1.62  vs   1.32</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   8.95  vs  12.56</p>
<p>    INterest expense	   1.26  vs   0.92</p>
<p>    Pretax			 5.44  vs   8.71</p>
<p>    Associates		   0.82  vs   1.49</p>
<p>    Tax			    1.80  vs   2.53</p>
<p>    Minorities	 (gain)  0.06  vs   0.27  (loss)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  (loss)  0.17  vs   nil</p>
<p>Note - Keppel Integrated Engineering Ltd, a unit of Keppel Corp, said it expects second half performance to be around the same as its first half.</p>
